WEEK 1 — REQUIREMENT ANALYSIS AND PROBLEM STUDY

Date: Monday, 10 August 2026

Problem: One bill had to carry different GST rates for clothes, electronics and food, but the first idea used one rate for the whole bill.

Solution:
- Studied how GST applies to retail goods.
- Stored the GST rate on each product through its HSN code.
- Added tax separately for each rate (5%, 12%, 18%).
- Split the tax for each rate into CGST and SGST.
- Chose a web app so that customers install nothing.
